# Localization

- Localization resources must live under `src/main/resources/localization/{language-code}/`.
  - Example: `localization/en/error_messages.json`, `localization/ru/error_messages.json`.
- Use ISO language code as the folder name (`en`, `ru`, ...).
- Use one file per locale in its locale folder.
- Do not use `app_errors` or locale suffixes in filenames.
